WEBVTT

00:09:55.446 --> 00:10:00.160
The mouth moves.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:04.231
We never stagnate.

00:10:04.231 --> 00:10:11.055
Life triumphs up and down.

00:10:11.055 --> 00:10:13.131
Kitra Cahana: For most of us,

00:10:13.131 --> 00:10:15.865
our muscles begin to twitch and move

00:10:15.865 --> 00:10:18.373
long before we are conscious,

00:10:18.373 --> 00:10:21.290
but my father tells me his privilege

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.469
is living on the far periphery

00:10:23.469 --> 00:10:26.472
of the human experience.

00:10:26.472 --> 00:10:29.104
Like an astronaut who sees a perspective

00:10:29.104 --> 00:10:32.322
that very few of us will ever get to share,